azine I definitely wouldn't call  Andromeda an open-world game we like to  use the term exploration based game you  still have the concept of tight story  deliverance and all the great things you  come to it  backed with mass effect adding the layer  on top of that is a layer of exploration  sometimes that happens in open spaces  but not always you can cruise around  some of these planets in the nomad but  it's not the traditional sandbox tight  game the Nomad is of course the new mako  which hopefully in no way resembles the  Mako at least not in terms of handling  new Andromeda screenshots arrived today  so be sure to check those out on games  but that is everything I've got for you  today do leave me your thoughts in that  comment section head to gamespot for all  our coverage of fauna which came out  today and i will see you again tomorrow
 

